
>> shop := (Isichazamazwi okusha
	beka: ['magazine'] endaweni: ['books'],
	beka: ['computer'] endaweni: ['electronics'],
	beka: ['lipstick'] endaweni: ['cosmetics']
).
Okuphumayo bhala: (shop ine: ['computer']), umugqa-omusha. 
Okuphumayo bhala: (shop ine: ['sausage']), umugqa-omusha. 
Okuphumayo bhala: (shop ine: ['computers']), umugqa-omusha. 
Okuphumayo bhala: (shop ine: ['compute']), umugqa-omusha. 
Okuphumayo bhala: (shop ine: ['2computer']), umugqa-omusha. 
